  textMesh: {fileID: 1582639465}
  message: "Ah, here is the control board in all its glory! Whether or not it\u2019s
    a good idea to take this meticulous project from the room and conceptually unravel
    it into an unfinished planet does not cross your mind. It\u2019s exactly what
    you need!\r\n\r\n\r\nPick it up and put it in your backpack to integrate it with
    the world!"
